SUMMARY:🎨 Movie Night &#8211\; Coco
LOCATION:The Ruth Bancroft Garden\, Walnut Creek
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a classic Halloween movie night featuring Coco at the Garden!\nCome early to stroll the Garden and Nursery\, stop by our craft stations on the Patio\, and grab some snacks and a drink before the movie starts on the Plaza!\n\nGates open: 5:30 pm\nMovie begins: TBD (on the Plaza)\n\nGarden gates will close at approximately 7:00 pm\, and no entry will be permitted.\nBring warm layers\, a lawn chair\, https://www.ruthbancroftgarden.org/event/movie-night-coco-october-30-6pm-9pm/
