SUMMARY:🎨 Movie Night- Coco\, October 30\, 6pm-9pm
LOCATION:The Ruth Bancroft Garden\, Walnut Creek
DESCRIPTION:Movie Night Under the Stars: Coco\nGet ready for a spooktacular night at the Garden! Bring the whole family on October 30 for a twilight adventure\, a fun Halloween craft\, popcorn\, drinks\, and Coco on the Plaza under the stars. Explore the Garden as dusk settles in\, then snuggle up for a magical movie night!\nCome early for the full experience! The Garden gates close at 7:00pm when the movie begins\,  (Ages all) https://www.ruthbancroftgarden.org/event/movie-night-coco-october-30-6pm-9pm/
